# Changelog

- Read root AGENTS.md and the current changelog section.
- Record material outcomes under UTC dates: requested problem/intent, change and
  reason, scope, preserved behavior, validation/limits and known human operator.
  Pure investigation needs no entry; keep routine logs/raw evidence local.
- Keep commit intent aligned with the entry. This skill grants no Git publication
  authority and does not override ignores.
- Before tracking normally excluded sensitive material, obtain artifact-specific
  approval and append who, what, exact paths, UTC when and conditions. Do not put
  the sensitive payload in that record; correct records additively.
